{"v":1,"path":"/Components/IUpgradeManager/IUpgradeManager.html","title":"DJI Mobile SDK Documentation","mainClass":"site-main","tocClass":"site-toc","mainHtml":"\n        <div id=\"ifm-overview\" class=\"article ifm-page\" data-prerender=\"overview members methods\"><div class=\"article\" style=\"display: none;\"><h1><font color=\"#AAA\">class </font>IUpgradeManager</h1></div>\n<figure class=\"highlight java\" style=\"display: none;\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">interface</span> <span class=\"title class_\">IUpgradeManager</span> </span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>Package:</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<nav class=\"ifm-breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><span>Common APIs</span><span class=\"ifm-breadcrumb-sep\">›</span><span aria-current=\"page\">IUpgradeManager</span></nav><div class=\"ifm-eyebrow\" id=\"ifm-overview\"><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-kind-badge\">class</span><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-since-badge\">Since MSDK 5.1.0</span></div><h1 class=\"ifm-title\">IUpgradeManager</h1><p class=\"ifm-lead\">Class to manage Firmware upgrade, It is used to get the latest firmware version and release note.</p><div class=\"ifm-meta-line\"><span class=\"ifm-meta-item\"><svg class=\"ifm-meta-icon\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 7.5 12 3l8 4.5v9L12 21l-8-4.5z\"></path><path d=\"m4 7.5 8 4.5 8-4.5M12 12v9\"></path></svg>Package <code>dji.v5.manager.interfaces</code><button class=\"ifm-mini-copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy=\"dji.v5.manager.interfaces\" aria-label=\"Copy package name\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-