nformation class.</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"iupgrademanager_upgradeablecomponentlistener_inline\" data-category=\"class\" data-search=\"upgradeablecomponentlistener the listener of upgradeable components.\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">class</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">UpgradeableComponentListener</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">The listener of upgradeable components.</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"iupgrademanager_upgradeinfolistener_inline\" data-category=\"class\" data-search=\"upgradeinfolistener upgrade progress information listener.\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">class</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">UpgradeInfoListener</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">Upgrade progress information listener.</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button></div></div></div><div class=\"ifm-empty-state\" id=\"ifm-empty\" style=\"display:none\">No matching members. Try a shorter keyword.</div></div>\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"iupgrademanager_addupgradeablecomponentlistener\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#iupgrademanager_addupgradeablecomponentlistener_inline\">addUpgradeableComponentListener</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"iupgrademanager_addupgradeablecomponentlistener_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>addUpgradeableComponentListener</h3></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">addUpgradeableComponentListener</span><span